# Shop module context (caveman)

- Path: Modules/Shop only.
- Root rules = base law. Always follow.
- This file = extra Shop law.

- Shop need Core, CMS, ERP, SAO. Missing one, Shop no run.
- Shop orchestrate. Items and orders live in ERP, content in CMS, support in SAO. Do not clone their logic.
- Dependency one-way: Shop know others, others know nothing of Shop.
- Tables prefixed `shop_`.
- Catalog foundation shipped: Product extends CMS Content via the content-extension seam, ProductVariant, VariantItem composition from ERP items. Storefront, cart, checkout, payments, reviews not built yet (plan #2+).

- Core change impact big. CMS/ERP/SAO change impact medium. Be careful.
- If requirement unclear or risky: stop and ask user.
